  dialogue:
  - Welcome To The Blood Rooms
  - 'There is currenty a blood coloured mist inhabiting these rooms. Contact with
    this mist will cause severe damage to your body if you stay too long. Complete
    your training before it''s too late '
  - Use your blood powers to defeat the enemies. And if you are about to fail, you
    can drink the blood in the fountains scattered around the lab to replenish.
